Error [jet.UnknownArgumentLabel]: `core.crypto.seal` has no parameter labelled `algorithm`
  --> tests/ui/crypto_safe_raw_algorithm.jet:5:32
    |
  5 |     _: crypto.seal([], [], [], algorithm: "xchacha20poly1305")
    |                                ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A label binds an argument to the parameter of that name
 Fix: `core.crypto.seal` accepts `recipients`, `bytes`, `aad`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0764
